## Original Content
La movilización comenzó en la zona del Fischer y se desplazó hasta la plaza de los Reyes, donde los manifestantes reclamaron información, garantías de seguridad y rechazaron que la ciudad "se convierta en un CETI".

## Summary
Hundreds of neighbors in Ceuta protested against the Government Delegation over the housing of migrants, demanding information and security guarantees. The protest moved from the Fischer area to plaza de los Reyes, rejecting the city becoming a CETI.

## Key Points
- Protest by residents of Ceuta against migrant accommodation
- Demands for information and security guarantees
- Opposition to Ceuta becoming a CETI (Temporary Stay Center for Immigrants)
- Mobilization from Fischer to plaza de los Reyes


